  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>Vairocana — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>At 18th level, you have finally learned to expand your domain. At initiative 20, you can choose a Chaos effect of 90 or below which functions as your guaranteed hit and can affect all creatures of your choice within your domain, depending on the effect. While within your domain, any uses of Chaos function as your domain’s guaranteed hit, allowing the range of the effect to encompass the entirety of your domain and letting you pick specific targets.</p>",
